{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301130","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1830113001:1":{"text":"生前があんなに美しかったんだもの。グレイヴボーンになっても、また違った美しさがあるはずよ。","source_cn":"塞涅小姐生前就那么漂亮，变成亡灵肯定有一种别样的美丽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8690D6F1A8D9CF91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830113002:1":{"text":"まだ亡くなって間もないし、そこまで大きな変化はないんじゃないか。","source_cn":"我认为塞涅刚成为亡灵，我感觉不会有太大的变化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x075C9FABE131B049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830113003:1":{"text":"きっと今の俺たちと同じで、目が光ってるくらいだろ？","source_cn":"应该就跟我们现在一样，双眼发光吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF905E0368900FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830113004:1":{"text":"それは間違いないだろうね。ほら、周りのみんなも目が光ってる。","source_cn":"双眼发光是肯定的，你们看这里的人都是双眼发光的呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x807EC4F34517245B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1830113005:1":{"text":"うわっ……よくよく見ると怖いわね……","source_cn":"咦惹，细看有点吓人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA916782FE042C357","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_tit